msgid ""
"This effect/filter scales the input by 2x and smooths it using the "
"Super2xSaI (Scale and Interpolate) pixel art scaling algorithm\\ [1]_."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter zväčší vstup 2x a vyhladí ho pomocou algoritmu pre "
"škálovanie pixel artu Super2xSaI (Scale and Interpolate)\\ [1]_."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/image_adjustment/super2xsai.rst:45
msgid "Useful for enlarging pixel art images without reducing sharpness."
msgstr "Užitočné na zväčšovanie obrázkov pixel art bez zníženia ostrosti."

